      "writtenOn": "2024-07-25T04:48:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am okay either way. It looks in a nutshell the Discard pass is implemented by `view-\u003eGetTexture()-\u003eSetIsSubresourceContentInitialized(false, range);` [here](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/CommandBuffer.cpp;drc\u003d2017cd8a8925f180257662f78eaf9eb93e8e394d;l\u003d186).\nHowever, the timing to call it should be during command buffer execution, whereas we are all about command buffer encoding here.",
      "parentUuid": "f8642231_f3124fd9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 251,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 285,
        "endChar": 13
      },
